{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Enter the Shadows. Embrace the Chase.</strong> \u2694\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the blade in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shininja</strong> is a fast-paced side-scrolling action runner that challenges your reflexes and precision. Take control of a shadowy ninja sprinting through procedurally generated environments filled with deadly traps, shifting terrain, and relentless hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Endless Runner Mechanics</strong>: Keep moving forward across an ever-changing landscape. The longer you survive, the faster and more dangerous the world becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Responsive Ninja Controls</strong>: Time your jumps, dashes, and strikes to navigate through fast-paced, obstacle-filled environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Dynamic Obstacles</strong>: Face randomized patterns that demand quick thinking and memorization. No two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Stylized Visuals &amp; Atmospheric Soundtrack</strong>: Immerse yourself in a minimalist world with fluid animations and moody music that intensifies as the action ramps up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Score Chasing</strong>: Compete for high scores and longest survival streaks. Every second counts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no mercy. No rewinds.<br>Only speed. Precision. Instinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash your inner ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How far can you go before the darkness swallows you whole?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650720/extras/hayate.png?t=1744958514\" /><img class=\